OpenWave for Debian
===================

Two things to do after installing.

Join the plugdev group, so an RTL-SDR dongle can be opened without root:

    sudo usermod -aG plugdev "$USER"

Then log out and in again. The udev rules this package installed take effect the next time the
dongle is plugged in.

For a DVB-T tuner, join the video group instead:

    sudo usermod -aG video "$USER"

The hardware drivers in this release have never been run against real hardware. If you have a
receiver, please report what happens:

    https://github.com/Mxlione/Openwave/issues
